_Bobo","c":3},{"y":416,"t":"gain","x":"416: Xia seizes Anding.","cp":"later-qin","cpn":"Later Qin","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Helian_Bobo","c":3},{"y":418,"t":"contest_start","x":"418: Bobo invades Guanzhong.","cp":"western-jin","cpn":"Jin dynasty (Western and Eastern Jin)","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xia_(Sixteen_Kingdoms)","c":3},{"y":418,"t":"gain","x":"418: Xia takes Chang'an and Guanzhong from the Jin.","cp":"western-jin","cpn":"Jin dynasty (Western and Eastern Jin)","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xia_(Sixteen_Kingdoms)","c":2},{"y":418,"t":"contest_end","x":"418: the Jin give up Guanzhong.","cp":"western-jin","cpn":"Jin dynasty (Western and Eastern Jin)","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xia_(Sixteen_Kingdoms)","c":2},{"y":426,"t":"contest_start","x":"426: Taiwu crosses the frozen Yellow River and attacks Tongwan.","cp":"northern-wei","cpn":"Northern Wei","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Helian_Chang","c":3},{"y":426,"t":"contest_start","x":"426: Xia strikes the Western Qin.","cp":"western-qin","cpn":"Western Qin","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Helian_Chang","c":3},{"y":426,"t":"contest_end","x":"426: the Xia raid ends.","cp":"western-qin","cpn":"Western Qin","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Helian_Chang","c":1},{"y":426,"t":"loss","x":"426: Chang'an and Puban are abandoned to the Wei.","cp":"northern-wei","cpn":"Northern Wei","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emperor_Taiwu_of_Northern_Wei","c":3},{"y":427,"t":"capital_move","x":"427: Helian Chang flees to Shanggui.","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xia_(Sixteen_Kingdoms)","c":3},{"y":427,"t":"loss","x":"427: Tongwancheng falls (11 July).","m":7,"cp":"northern-wei","cpn":"Northern Wei","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xia_(Sixteen_Kingdoms)","c":3},{"y":428,"t":"capital_move","x":"428: Helian Ding makes Pingliang the capital.","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xia_(Sixteen_Kingdoms)","c":3},{"y":428,"t":"gain","x":"428: Xia recovers Chang'an.","cp":"northern-wei","cpn":"Northe